  "name": "IGH (MM)",
  "code": "IGHMM",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"687\">\n<li data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"532\">\n<p data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"532\"><strong data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"428\">Purpose:</strong> Detects clonal B-cell populations by analyzing rearrangements in the immunoglobulin heavy chain gene.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"687\">\n<p data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"687\"><strong data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"552\">Clinical Use:</strong> Helps diagnose <strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"600\">B-cell lymphomas / leukemias</strong> and distinguish between reactive (polyclonal) and malignant (clonal) proliferations.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_sk2ct_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_sk2ct_13 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<thead data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"716\">\n<tr data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"716\">\n<th data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"698\" data-col-size=\"md\">Result</th>\n<th data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"716\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Interpretation</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<tr data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"859\">\n<td data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"795\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"794\">Polyclonal pattern (negative for clonality)</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"859\">Suggests a reactive process (e.g., infection, inflammation).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"1060\">\n<td data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"911\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"910\">Monoclonal rearrangement detected (positive)</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1060\">Supports diagnosis of a clonal B-cell malignancy (e.g., non-Hodgkin lymphoma, CLL). Must be correlated with histopathology and immunophenotyping.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<td data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1093\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1092\">Indeterminate / Equivocal</strong></td>\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1191\">Test inconclusive, may require repeat analysis or additional studies (flow cytometry, biopsy).</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
